<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>LOVLOV 메타광고 대시보드</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@500;700&family=Pretendard:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#FAF9F6; --ink:#1A1D29; --ink-soft:#5B5A54; --line:#E8E3D9;
    --card:#FFFFFF; --brown:#6B5842; --brown-soft:#F1EBE0;
    --green:#3D7068; --green-soft:#E6F0EE; --red:#B84A3E; --red-soft:#FBECE9;
    --radius:14px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:'Pretendard',-apple-system,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;padding:0 0 60px;}
  .wrap{max-width:1220px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}

  header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:32px 0 0;margin-bottom:0;position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--bg);z-index:10;}
  .eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--brown);font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px;}
  h1{font-family:'Noto Serif KR',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:30px;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px;}
  .meta-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px;}
  .meta-text{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .update-badge{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:100px;}
  .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);flex:none;}

  .tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;}
  .tab{
    padding:11px 22px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft);
    border-bottom:2.5px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;
    font-family:'Noto Serif KR',serif;
  }
  .tab:hover{color:var(--ink);}
  .tab.active{color:var(--brown);border-bottom-color:var(--brown);}

  main{padding-top:28px;}
  .view{display:none;}
  .view.active{display:block;}

  .kpi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin-bottom:32px;}
  .kpi-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:20px 22px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
  .kpi-card::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;right:0;width:0;height:0;border-style:solid;border-width:0 22px 22px 0;border-color:transparent var(--brown-soft) transparent transparent;}
  .kpi-label{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .kpi-value{font-family:'Noto Serif KR',serif;font-size:25px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-.01em;}
  .kpi-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--green);font-weight:600;margin-top:6px;}
  .kpi-sub.warn{color:var(--red);}

  section{margin-bottom:32px;}
  .section-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:16px;}
  .section-title{font-family:'Noto Serif KR',serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;}
  .section-note{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);}

  .two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:16px;}
  .panel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px 24px;}
  .chart-wrap{position:relative;height:230px;}

  .split-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:14px;}
  .split-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px 20px;}
  .split-title{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:12px;}
  .bar-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:9px;font-size:13px;}
  .bar-label{width:64px;flex:none;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .bar-track{flex:1;height:8px;background:var(--brown-soft);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;}
  .bar-fill{height:100%;background:var(--brown);border-radius:4px;}
  .bar-val{width:44px;flex:none;text-align:right;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}

  /* creative grid */
  .creative-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:14px;}
  .creative-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
  .thumb-wrap{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;background:var(--brown-soft);overflow:hidden;}
  .thumb-wrap img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;}
  .thumb-wrap .type-badge{
    position:absolute;top:8px;left:8px;background:rgba(26,29,41,.72);color:#fff;
    font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;
  }
  .creative-body{padding:12px 14px 14px;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;}
  .creative-title{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;color:var(--ink);
    display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;min-height:34px;}
  .creative-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px 10px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .creative-stats b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
  .perf-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;width:fit-content;}
  .perf-badge.good{background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green);}
  .perf-badge.bad{background:var(--red-soft);color:var(--red);}

  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13.5px;}
  thead th{text-align:left;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600;padding:0 12px 10px;border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--line);}
  thead th.num{text-align:right;}
  tbody td{padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:middle;}
  tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}
  tbody tr:hover{background:#FCFBF9;}
  td.num{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}

  /* glossary */
  .glossary-search{width:100%;max-width:320px;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;font-size:13.5px;font-family:'Pretendard',sans-serif;background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:20px;}
  .glossary-search:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--brown);}
  .glossary-group{margin-bottom:28px;}
  .glossary-group-title{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--brown);letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px;}
  .glossary-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:12px;}
  .term-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px 18px;}
  .term-card.hidden{display:none;}
  .term-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .term-abbr{font-family:'Noto Serif KR',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:var(--ink);}
  .term-kr{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--brown);font-weight:600;}
  .term-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.55;}
  .term-example{margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .term-example b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;}

  footer{margin-top:40px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;}

  @media (max-width:900px){
    .kpi-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
    .two-col{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .split-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .tabs{overflow-x:auto;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header>
    <div class="eyebrow">LOVLOV · Performance Marketing</div>
    <h1>메타광고 대시보드</h1>
    <div class="meta-row">
      <div class="meta-text">계정: 로브로브 (LOVLOV) · 마지막 갱신 <strong id="reportDate">2026년 7월 29일</strong></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tabs">
      <div class="tab active" data-view="daily">일간</div>
      <div class="tab" data-view="weekly">주간</div>
      <div class="tab" data-view="monthly">월간</div>
      <div class="tab" data-view="alltime">전체추이</div>
      <div class="tab" data-view="creatives">소재 라이브러리</div>
      <div class="tab" data-view="glossary">용어 정리</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap" style="padding-left:0;padding-right:0;">

    <!-- ===== 일간 ===== -->
    <div class="view active" id="view-daily">
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">전일 광고비 소진</div><div class="kpi-value">₩216,470</div><div class="kpi-sub">7/29 기준</div></div>
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">전일 노출수</div><div class="kpi-value">26,472</div><div class="kpi-sub">CPM 평균 ₩8,177</div></div>
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">전일 클릭수</div><div class="kpi-value">1,939</div><div class="kpi-sub">CTR 7.32%</div></div>
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">운영중 소재 수</div><div class="kpi-value">19개</div><div class="kpi-sub warn">에어플로우_투박한바람막이 최다 지출</div></div>
      </div>

      <section>
        <div class="section-head"><div class="section-title">최근 7일 추이</div><div class="section-note">7/23 – 7/29</div></div>
        <div class="two-col">
          <div class="panel"><div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="dailySpendChart" role="img" aria-label="일별 광고비 소진 막대그래프">7/23 138,565원부터 7/29 216,470원까지 일별 소진 추이</canvas></div></div>
          <div class="panel"><div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="dailyImpChart" role="img" aria-label="일별 노출수 라인그래프">7/23 8,772건부터 7/29 26,472건까지 일별 노출 추이</canvas></div></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="section-head"><div class="section-title">전일 소재별 성과</div><div class="section-note">7/29 · 광고비 높은 순</div></div>
        <div class="panel" style="padding:10px 8px;">
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>소재</th><th class="num">노출수</th><th class="num">클릭수</th><th class="num">CTR</th><th class="num">광고비</th><th class="num">ROAS</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="dailyTableBody"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== 주간 ===== -->
    <div class="view" id="view-weekly">
      <div class="kpi-grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);">
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">주간 광고비 소진</div><div class="kpi-value">₩1,676,617</div><div class="kpi-sub">7/23–7/29 · ACTIVE 43개 소재</div></div>
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">주간 노출수</div><div class="kpi-value">152,718</div><div class="kpi-sub">CPM 평균 ₩10,979</div></div>
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">주간 클릭수</div><div class="kpi-value">9,836</div><div class="kpi-sub">CTR 6.44%</div></div>
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">주간 전체 ROAS</div><div class="kpi-value">2.63x</div><div class="kpi-sub">전환 미추적 소재 포함 전체 광고비 기준</div></div>
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">주간 DB(회원가입)</div><div class="kpi-value">18건</div><div class="kpi-sub">인스타그램 채널 100%</div></div>
      </div>

      <section>
        <div class="section-head"><div class="section-title">일별 소진 · 노출 추이</div><div class="section-note">최근 7일</div></div>
        <div class="two-col">
          <div class="panel"><div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="weeklySpendChart" role="img" aria-label="주간 일별 광고비 소진 막대그래프">7일간 광고비 소진 추이</canvas></div></div>
          <div class="panel"><div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="weeklyImpChart" role="img" aria-label="주간 일별 노출수 라인그래프">7일간 노출수 추이</canvas></div></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="section-head"><div class="section-title">소재별 누적 성과</div><div class="section-note">최근 7일 합산 · 광고비 높은 순</div></div>
        <div class="panel" style="padding:10px 8px;">
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>소재</th><th class="num">노출수</th><th class="num">클릭수</th><th class="num">CTR</th><th class="num">CPM</th><th class="num">광고비</th><th class="num">ROAS</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="weeklyTableBody"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div class="section-note" style="margin-top:10px;">※ ROAS "–"는 해당 소재가 랜딩페이지뷰 등 구매 전환을 추적하지 않는 목표로 운영중이라 매출 연결이 안 되는 경우입니다. 실제 구매 전환을 추적하는 소재만 ROAS가 표시됩니다.</div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== 월간 ===== -->
    <div class="view" id="view-monthly">
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">7월 광고비 소진</div><div class="kpi-value">₩16,969,895</div><div class="kpi-sub">7/1–7/30</div></div>
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">7월 노출수</div><div class="kpi-value">1,022,331</div><div class="kpi-sub">FB+IG+Threads 합산</div></div>
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">7월 DB(회원가입)</div><div class="kpi-value">29건</div><div class="kpi-sub">인스타그램 96.4%</div></div>
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">주요 유입층</div><div class="kpi-value">35–44세</div><div class="kpi-sub">여성 · DB의 48%</div></div>
      </div>

      <section>
        <div class="section-head"><div class="section-title">7월 DB(회원가입) 유입 분석</div><div class="section-note">총 29건</div></div>
        <div class="split-grid">
          <div class="split-card">
            <div class="split-title">채널별</div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label">인스타그램</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:96.4%"></div></div><span class="bar-val">28건</span></div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label">Threads</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:3.6%"></div></div><span class="bar-val">1건</span></div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label">페이스북</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:0%"></div></div><span class="bar-val">0건</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="split-card">
            <div class="split-title">연령대별</div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label">18-24</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:7%"></div></div><span class="bar-val">2건</span></div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label">25-34</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:21%"></div></div><span class="bar-val">6건</span></div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label">35-44</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:48%"></div></div><span class="bar-val">14건</span></div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label">45-54</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:14%"></div></div><span class="bar-val">4건</span></div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label">55-64</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:7%"></div></div><span class="bar-val">2건</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="split-card">
            <div class="split-title">성별</div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label">여성</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:96.5%"></div></div><span class="bar-val">28건</span></div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label">남성</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:0%"></div></div><span class="bar-val">0건</span></div>
            <div class="bar-row"><span class="bar-label">미상</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:3.5%"></div></div><span class="bar-val">1건</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="section-head"><div class="section-title">주차별 광고비 소진 추이</div><div class="section-note">7월 1주차 – 4주차</div></div>
        <div class="panel"><div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="monthlyChart" role="img" aria-label="7월 주차별 광고비 소진 막대그래프">1주차 3,120,450원, 2주차 3,850,200원, 3주차 4,415,410원, 4주차 5,583,835원</canvas></div></div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== 전체추이 ===== -->
    <div class="view" id="view-alltime">
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">누적 운영 기간</div><div class="kpi-value">3개월+</div><div class="kpi-sub">5월 – 7월</div></div>
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">최근 3개월 소진</div><div class="kpi-value">₩38.2M</div><div class="kpi-sub">5–7월 합산</div></div>
        <div class="kpi-card"><div class="kpi-label">월평균 CTR</div><div class="kpi-value">6.8%</div><div class="kpi-sub">3개월 평균</div></div>
        <div class="kpi-card warn"><div class="kpi-label">지속 관찰 필요</div><div class="kpi-value">CPM 상승세</div><div class="kpi-sub warn">7월 들어 CPM 우상향</div></div>
      </div>

      <section>
        <div class="section-head"><div class="section-title">월별 광고비 · CTR 추이</div><div class="section-note">최근 3개월</div></div>
        <div class="panel"><div class="chart-wrap" style="height:280px;"><canvas id="alltimeChart" role="img" aria-label="최근 3개월 월별 광고비와 CTR 추이 복합 그래프">5월 10,850,200원 CTR 7.1%, 6월 11,050,600원 CTR 6.9%, 7월 16,969,895원 CTR 6.5%</canvas></div></div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="section-note" style="margin-top:-8px;">※ 전체추이 데이터는 최근 3개월 요약 기준이며, 세부 일자별 원천 데이터는 광고관리자에서 추가 확인 가능합니다.</div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== 소재 라이브러리 ===== -->
    <div class="view" id="view-creatives">
      <div class="section-head"><div class="section-title">운영중 소재 라이브러리</div><div class="section-note">현재 집행중인 ACTIVE 광고 전체 43개 · 최근 7일 누적 성과</div></div>
      <div class="creative-grid" id="creativeGrid"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== 용어 정리 ===== -->
    <div class="view" id="view-glossary">
      <div class="section-head"><div class="section-title">광고 용어 정리</div><div class="section-note">헷갈리는 용어는 검색으로 바로 찾아보세요</div></div>
      <input type="text" class="glossary-search" id="glossarySearch" placeholder="용어 검색 (예: CPM, 노출)">

